189
00:11:31,280 --> 00:11:36,060
My hobbies are bishoujo anime,
bishoujo figures, and bishoujo games.

190
00:11:36,500 --> 00:11:37,700
Bishoujo games.

191
00:11:37,700 --> 00:11:39,900
Especially Dokimemo anxiety.

192
00:11:39,900 --> 00:11:41,940
Can I ask you something?

193
00:11:42,680 --> 00:11:45,600
How do I invite Saotome Saori to the pool?

194
00:11:45,940 --> 00:11:47,558
Well, that's easy. Right,

195
00:11:47,608 --> 00:11:50,340
I have it with me,
so shall we try it out for real?

196
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:52,560
Wow, passed!

197
00:11:53,120 --> 00:11:53,800
Eeeh?

198
00:11:54,640 --> 00:11:55,480
Nice to meet you.

199
00:11:56,090 --> 00:11:56,860
Passed!

200
00:11:58,040 --> 00:11:58,460
Nice to meet you.

201
00:11:59,220 --> 00:12:00,060
Passed!

202
00:12:00,800 --> 00:12:01,640
Hi.

203
00:12:01,640 --> 00:12:02,580
Passed!

204
00:12:03,940 --> 00:12:04,740
Nice to meet you, then.

205
00:12:04,740 --> 00:12:05,780
Hi.

206
00:12:09,740 --> 00:12:13,000
In the end,
all seven rooms got filled after all.

207
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:18,280
We set the rent at 65,000 yen a month,
including meals.

208
00:12:18,280 --> 00:12:21,700
With the deposits and key money together,
that comes to 260,000 yen.

209
00:12:22,280 --> 00:12:24,940
So the total, multiplied by seven,

210
00:12:25,660 --> 00:12:27,200
comes to 1,820,000 yen.

211
00:12:27,820 --> 00:12:29,120
We did it, Ryotsu.

212
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:31,680
No, it's thanks to everyone's cooperation.

213
00:12:31,680 --> 00:12:34,240
This is getting fun, Ryo-san.

214
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:37,800
No, no. One more drink.

215
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:40,720
Chief!

216
00:12:41,520 --> 00:12:42,820
