231
00:13:40,140 --> 00:13:43,580
Of course, because my lovely
room is gleaming, after all.

232
00:13:44,140 --> 00:13:46,200
Well then, Chief. Make yourself at home.

233
00:13:46,400 --> 00:13:49,360
Phew, what a relief.

234
00:13:50,680 --> 00:13:51,740
